        "1697": {"synopsis":"Moves the cursor (row C, column B) one place left within the text: to the column before\n(TEXT_END_LEFT), or up a row (ROW_UP) to the end of its text.\nEntry: A = the remembered column.\nExit: carry when it moved, A = the new column; otherwise no carry.","comment":"D = the remembered column"},
