        "1970": {"synopsis":"Before the cursor leaves row C downwards: when the line was edited ($D5B7 bit 3) and row C\nis its last row (flags bit 3), the line is entered (EDIT_LINE_ENTER).\nExit: carry to go on (no carry: a report).","comment":"A = $D5B7"},
