        "2222": {"synopsis":"Gives the next character of the line being entered, read from the editor's rows (from\n$15EA). The reader's state at $D5AF (bit 7: count the characters in $D5B5; bits 0-3: 1 the\nrows above the window, 2 the window, 4 the rows below, 8 done), column $D5B0, row $D5B1; the\nstate's routine from ROWS_CHAR_TABLE. Codes 1-$1F come back changed as the row drawing\n($11DE) changes them; 0 (the line's end) as $0D.\nExit: A = the character.","comment":"HL = the reader's state"},
        "2225": {"comment":"Counting the places?"},
        "2229": {"comment":"One place more"},
