        "2329": {"synopsis":"State 2: the next character from window row C (ROW_ADDRESS). Reaching the cursor's place\n($D745 row, $D746 column) stops the counting ($D5AF bit 7 cleared). The line's last row ends\nit (L = 8, A = 0); past row ($D74A), state 4 from row 1.\nExit: A = the character, L = the state."},
        "2330": {"comment":"HL = the cursor's row"},
