        "2466": {"synopsis":"Is column B of the row at DE in or next to text? Carry when the character at B is not 0, or\n(B not 0) the one before it is not; otherwise B moves right over 0s to the next character\n(carry), or no carry when none is left.\nExit: HL = the column's address, A = the character there.","comment":"HL = column B's address"},
