        "2529": {"synopsis":"Inserts character A at the cursor (row C, column B), the rest of the line moving right\nacross its rows; nothing when the rows are full ($D5B7 bit 0). A character pushed off a row\ngoes into the next row of the line, or into a new row inserted after it (INSERT_ROW, the row\nmarked as continued); off the window's last row it goes into the rows below (BELOW_CARRY).\nEach changed row redrawn ($1169, $100C).\nExit: carry when done. Keeps BC.","comment":"HL = $D5B7"},
