        "2911": {"synopsis":"Key $1B: deletes left of the cursor: the spaces before it, then the word before them,\nstopping at the line's start (AT_LINE_START); the space before the word is kept. Then\nDEL_KEY_END.","comment":"The cursor off; HL = $D748"},
