        "2971": {"synopsis":"The end of a deleting key: the line's rows redrawn (ROWS_REDRAW_LINE), $D741 bit 2 cleared\nand the window's rows 0 to ($D73C) redrawn (ROWS_DRAW), $D5B7 bit 3 set, the cursor stored\n(CURSOR_PUT).\nExit: the carry given on entry.","comment":"A = the column"},
