        "3153": {"synopsis":"DE = the address of row C of the editor's window, the rows from $C000 in bank 7, ($D73F)\nbytes each: ($D73D) columns of characters, a flags byte, the line number (high byte first).\nKeeps AF, BC.","comment":"The window's rows in bank 7"},
        "3156": {"synopsis":"DE = HL + ($D73F) x C: row C of the rows from HL (BELOW_ROW_ADDR for $C73B, $0E5E for\n$CE76).\nExit: HL = ($D73F). Keeps AF, BC."},
