        "3187": {"synopsis":"Takes the next row from those kept below the window (rows from $C73B, count at $C738): with\nrows kept, $D5B7 bit 0 cleared and the rows shifted up one, the first given; with none, the\nnext program line after ($D74C) (from $1401; line 0 tried as 1) turned into rows ($0E64),\nthe first given and the rest kept.\nExit: HL = $C73B, the row; carry from the routine that made it. Keeps BC, DE."},
