        "3251": {"comment":"The count stored"},
        "3252": {"comment":"HL = the row given"},
        "3258": {"synopsis":"Puts the editor row at DE (($D73D) characters, a flags byte, the line number high byte\nfirst) in front of the rows kept below the window.\n1. A line's first row with flags bit 4 also sets $D74C to the line before its number ($1881,\n   $13F9), when there is one.\n2. A line's first row (bit 0) is not kept: the buffer is emptied ($C738 = 0), carry.\n3. Otherwise, with room for one more ($0EEE), the row goes in as row 1 (copied to row 0,\n   then all rows moved down one) and the count goes up; carry. No room: no carry.\nExit: A = the count. Keeps BC, DE."},
        "3260": {"comment":"HL = the width"},
        "3263": {"comment":"HL = the flags byte"},
        "3264": {"comment":"A = the flags"},
        "3265": {"comment":"Bits 0 and 4 both set?"},
        "3268": {"comment":"No"},
