        "4009": {"synopsis":"Finds the program line numbered HL (BC = HL) from PROG ($5C53); the program must be paged\nin. BC = 0 takes the first line.\nExit: carry, Z and HL = the line, DE = the line before it (0 for the first); no carry when\nthere is none, DE = the last line.\nChanges: AF, BC."},
        "4010": {"comment":"BC = the number wanted"},
        "4011": {"comment":"No line before yet"},
        "4014": {"comment":"HL = PROG"},
        "4017": {"comment":"A program at all?"},
