        "4530": {"comment":"LoRes: half of each"},
        "4534": {"synopsis":"On with the drawing.","comment":"On with the drawing"},
        "4537": {"synopsis":"Ends the statement when checking syntax (through $0149: the caller does not come back);\nrunning, the screen mode must be one with tiles ($2D78 gives carry), otherwise error code\n$5E (ERROR_128_A).\nExit: A = the mode from $2D78, 1 for LoRes (also used to choose LoRes's or Layer 2's\nvariables).\nChanges: AF, BC, DE, HL.","comment":"HL = the return address"},
        "4538": {"comment":"Checking syntax: the statement ends here"},
        "4541": {"comment":"The screen mode's tile kind ($2D78): carry when it has one"},
        "4544": {"comment":"The return address back"},
        "4545": {"comment":"A mode with tiles: return"},
        "4546": {"comment":"Otherwise error code $5E (NextZXOS ROM 1's ERROR_128_A)"},
        "4563": {"synopsis":"A = A x 8, or A x 16 when the tiles are 16 x 16 ($5BBE bit 4).\nChanges: AF.","comment":"X 8"},
        "4566": {"comment":"16 x 16 tiles?"},
        "4570": {"comment":"No: x 8 is all"},
        "4571": {"comment":"X 16"},
        "4573": {"synopsis":"Pages 16K bank L at $8000-$BFFF (MMU slots 4-5) and bank H at $C000-$FFFF (MMU slots 6-7):\nHL doubled gives their first 8K pages.\nEntry: L, H = the banks.\nChanges: AF, HL.","comment":"H and L: the banks as 8K page numbers"},
        "4574": {"comment":"Bank L's two pages"},
        "4575": {"comment":"At $8000-$BFFF"},
        "4582": {"comment":"Bank H's two pages"},
        "4583": {"comment":"At $C000-$FFFF"},
        "4591": {"synopsis":"TILE BANK n (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for TILE BANK, the word at its $04FB): bank\nn is checked through NextZXOS ROM 1's BANK_PAGE_ROM3 (past its HL test, at $330F) and\nbecomes the tile bank of the current mode: $5B73 for LoRes, $5B75 for Layer 2.","comment":"Checking: done; running: A = the mode (1 LoRes)"},
        "4594": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "4595": {"comment":"A = the bank (NextZXOS ROM 1's TAKE_BYTE)"},
        "4610": {"comment":"E = the bank"},
        "4611": {"comment":"Is it a bank? (NextZXOS ROM 1's BANK_PAGE_ROM3 past its HL test)"},
        "4626": {"comment":"A = the mode"},
        "4627": {"comment":"LoRes?"},
        "4628": {"comment":"A = the bank"},
        "4629": {"comment":"Yes"},
        "4631": {"comment":"$5B75 = Layer 2's tile bank"},
        "4635": {"synopsis":"$5B73 = LoRes's tile bank.","comment":"$5B73 = LoRes's tile bank"},
        "4639": {"synopsis":"Back from the other stack ($00EC), then ERR_B. Also reached from $2CE2.","comment":"Back to the normal stack first"},
        "4642": {"synopsis":"Stops with error code $0A, report B (NextZXOS ROM 1's ERROR_128_A). Reached from all over\nthe page.","comment":"Error code $0A: report B (NextZXOS ROM 1's ERROR_128_A)"},
        "4659": {"synopsis":"RAM bank 0 and the normal stack back ($00E8), then ERR_B. Also reached from $07AE.","comment":"RAM bank 0 and the normal stack back first"},
        "4662": {"comment":"Then report B"},
        "4664": {"synopsis":"TILE DIM bank, offset, width, size (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for TILE DIM, the\nword at its $0501): the tile map of the current mode:\n1. The tile size 8 or 16 (report B otherwise) into $5BBE.\n2. The map width 1-2048 in tiles (report B otherwise), the map's offset and bank checked by\n   NextZXOS ROM 1's BANK_PAGE_ROM3 (an offset of $4000 or more is report B).\n3. Layer 2: width $5B7E, bank $5B76, offset $5B82, 16 x 16 tiles in $5C7F bit 7. LoRes\n   (TILE_DIM_LORES): $5B7C, $5B74, $5B80 and $5C7F bit 6.","comment":"Checking: done; running: A = the mode (1 LoRes)"},
        "4667": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "4668": {"comment":"A = the tile size (NextZXOS ROM 1's TAKE_BYTE)"},
        "4683": {"comment":"8?"},
        "4685": {"comment":"Yes"},
        "4687": {"comment":"16?"},
        "4689": {"comment":"Neither: report B"},
        "4691": {"synopsis":"The tile size kept in $5BBE.","comment":"$5BBE = the tile size"},
        "4694": {"comment":"BC = the map width (NextZXOS ROM 1's TAKE_WORD)"},
        "4709": {"comment":"0?"},
        "4711": {"comment":"Yes: report B"},
        "4713": {"comment":"Over 2048?"},
        "4717": {"comment":"Yes: report B"},
        "4719": {"comment":"BC = the width again"},
        "4720": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "4721": {"comment":"BC = the map's offset (NextZXOS ROM 1's TAKE_WORD)"},
        "4736": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "4737": {"comment":"A = the map's bank (NextZXOS ROM 1's TAKE_BYTE)"},
        "4752": {"comment":"HL = the offset"},
        "4753": {"comment":"BC = the width"},
        "4754": {"comment":"D = the bank"},
        "4755": {"comment":"Bank A and offset HL checked (NextZXOS ROM 1's BANK_PAGE_ROM3)"},
        "4770": {"comment":"A = the mode"},
