        "7248": {"synopsis":"AY register D = E on all three chips: AY 3 ($FD), AY 2 ($FE), then AY 1 ($FF), each selected\nthrough port $FFFD (AY 1 is left selected).\nChanges: AF, BC.","comment":"The TurboSound control port"},
        "7251": {"comment":"AY 3 first"},
