        "7748": {"comment":"More strings"},
        "7751": {"synopsis":"A short wait (1 unit), then each new note's volume, the strings taken from the word's bits,\nlowest first.","comment":"One unit's wait"},
        "7757": {"comment":"The list from its start"},
        "7760": {"synopsis":"The next string.","comment":"BC = the new notes' bits"},
        "7761": {"comment":"This string's bit into carry"},
        "7765": {"comment":"The rest kept"},
        "7766": {"comment":"No new note: the next"},
        "7768": {"comment":"IX = its block, its AY chip selected"},
        "7771": {"comment":"A = the AY channel"},
        "7774": {"comment":"Always below 3"},
        "7778": {"comment":"Register 8 + the channel"},
        "7781": {"comment":"= the volume"},
        "7787": {"synopsis":"On, while bits are left.","comment":"BC = the bits left"},
        "7788": {"comment":"None?"},
        "7790": {"comment":"Yes: done"},
        "7791": {"comment":"Kept"},
        "7792": {"comment":"The list's place on to the next block"},
        "7795": {"comment":"Again"},
        "7797": {"synopsis":"The AY tone periods for notes 21 up, one word each: 108 of them (notes 21-128); note 21's\n($0FBF) is also every lower note's; note 60's is $01A8. The 128K ROM 0's table unchanged."},
        "8013": {"synopsis":"CAT [-] [#n] [name] [EXP] (from NextZXOS ROM 1's syntax entry for CAT, the word at its\n$0371): catalogues a drive's directory:\n1. '-': 8.3 names instead of long ones ($5B66 bit 7). An optional '#' stream, else stream 2\n   (NextZXOS ROM 1's STREAM_OPT_2). ASN goes to $219A (the drives), TAB to $21E2.\n2. An optional name (a string) and EXP (the details: $5B66 bit 6); checking syntax ends\n   here. A letter before a ':' in the name is the drive ($5B65; 0 for the default one). \"T:\"\n   (either case) is the tape, at $231F.\n3. The name to $E090 in bank 7; with bank 7 paged, DOS_CATALOG (ROM 2) fills the 64-entry\n   buffer at $F700, sorted by long name, with directories (and system files with EXP).\n4. Each entry: its long name from IDE_GET_LFN (ROM 2) or, with '-', its 8.3 name; TAB 25;\n   with EXP its attributes, date and time and size in bytes, otherwise its size in K or\n   \"<DIR>\"; BREAK stops it (NextZXOS ROM 1's BREAK_STOP). A full buffer goes on from its\n   last entry.\n5. \"No files found\" when nothing matched; then the drive's free space (DOS_FREE_SPACE) and \"\n   free\".\nErrors from ROM 2 stop it through NextZXOS ROM 1's DOS_ERROR_BANK0.","comment":"$5B66 bits 7 and 6 cleared: no '-', no EXP"},
        "8020": {"comment":"'-'?"},
        "8022": {"comment":"No"},
        "8024": {"comment":"$5B66 bit 7: 8.3 names"},
        "8026": {"comment":"Past it"},
        "8027": {"synopsis":"The stream, then what follows.","comment":"An optional '#' stream, else stream 2 (NextZXOS ROM 1's STREAM_OPT_2)"},
        "8042": {"comment":"A = the character there"},
        "8043": {"comment":"Z at ENTER or ':' (NextZXOS ROM 1's STMT_END_TEST)"},
        "8058": {"comment":"No name: everything"},
        "8060": {"comment":"EXP?"},
        "8062": {"comment":"Yes: everything, with the details"},
        "8064": {"comment":"ASN?"},
        "8066": {"comment":"Yes: the drives ($219A)"},
        "8069": {"comment":"TAB?"},
        "8071": {"comment":"Yes: the cards ($21E2)"},
        "8074": {"comment":"A string: the name (NextZXOS ROM 1's CLASS_A)"},
        "8089": {"comment":"A = the character after it"},
        "8090": {"comment":"EXP?"},
        "8092": {"comment":"No"},
        "8094": {"comment":"$5B66 bit 6: the details"},
        "8099": {"comment":"Past EXP"},
        "8100": {"synopsis":"Checking ends here; running, a drive letter A-Z before a ':' in the name kept at $5B65.","comment":"Checking syntax: the statement ends here"},
        "8103": {"comment":"DE = the name, BC = its length (NextZXOS ROM 1's STK_FETCH)"},
        "8118": {"comment":"The length kept"},
        "8119": {"comment":"HL = the name"},
        "8121": {"comment":"A ':' in it?"},
        "8125": {"comment":"No: no drive letter"},
        "8127": {"comment":"HL = the character before the ':'"},
        "8129": {"comment":"Capitals"},
        "8132": {"comment":"Below A?"},
        "8134": {"comment":"Not a letter"},
        "8136": {"comment":"Past Z?"},
        "8138": {"comment":"Not a letter"},
        "8140": {"comment":"$5B65 = the drive letter"},
        "8143": {"comment":"On"},
        "8145": {"synopsis":"No drive letter in the name: $5B65 = 0, the default drive.","comment":"$5B65 = 0: the default drive"},
        "8149": {"synopsis":"BC = the length again.","comment":"BC = the length"},
        "8150": {"comment":"On"},
        "8152": {"synopsis":"EXP with no name: the details.","comment":"$5B66 bit 6: the details"},
        "8157": {"comment":"Past EXP"},
        "8158": {"synopsis":"Checking ends here; an empty name, the default drive.","comment":"Checking syntax: the statement ends here"},
        "8161": {"comment":"$5B65 = 0: the default drive"},
        "8165": {"comment":"BC = 0: no name"},
        "8167": {"synopsis":"A name of two characters, T and ':' (either case): the tape, at $231F.","comment":"Two characters?"},
        "8171": {"comment":"No: the disk"},
        "8173": {"comment":"The second"},
        "8176": {"comment":"':'?"},
        "8178": {"comment":"No: the disk"},
        "8180": {"comment":"The first"},
        "8181": {"comment":"T or t?"},
        "8183": {"comment":"Yes: the tape ($231F)"},
        "8188": {"synopsis":"The name to $E090 in bank 7; bank 7 paged in; the buffer's first entry at $F700 cleared (13\nbytes).","comment":"The name to $E090 in bank 7, $FF after it ($2C2D)"},
        "8191": {"comment":"RAM bank 7 at $C000, the other stack"},
        "8194": {"comment":"Entry 0 of the buffer at $F700 cleared: from the start"},
        "8206": {"synopsis":"One part of the catalogue: B = 64 entries, C = $26 (long-name flags, directories, sorting by\nA), $27 with EXP (system files too); then CAT_CALL.","comment":"B = 64 entries, C = $26: long names, directories, sorting"},
        "8209": {"comment":"With EXP?"},
        "8214": {"comment":"No"},
        "8216": {"comment":"C = $27: system files too"},
        "8218": {"synopsis":"DOS_CATALOG (ROM 2) with DE = the buffer at $F700, HL = the name at $E090, A = 8 (sorted by\nlong name).","comment":"DE = the buffer"},
        "8221": {"comment":"HL = the name"},
        "8224": {"comment":"A = 8: sorted by long name"},
        "8226": {"comment":"DOS_CATALOG (ROM 2)"},
        "8229": {"comment":"An error"},
        "8232": {"synopsis":"Waits while SPACE is down.","comment":"Keyboard row SPACE-B"},
        "8237": {"comment":"Wait while SPACE is down"},
        "8239": {"comment":"FLAGS bit 5 cleared: no key yet"},
        "8243": {"comment":"$D7FF = the directory handle"},
        "8246": {"comment":"HL = entry 1, the first new one"},
        "8249": {"comment":"B = the new entries"},
        "8251": {"comment":"Any?"},
        "8252": {"comment":"Yes"},
        "8254": {"comment":"None: the end"},
        "8257": {"synopsis":"An error from ROM 2: $17 (nothing matched) is CAT_NONE; the others stop it through NextZXOS\nROM 1's DOS_ERROR_BANK0.","comment":"$17: nothing matched?"},
        "8259": {"comment":"Yes: the end"},
        "8262": {"synopsis":"RAM bank 0, then the error in A stops it (NextZXOS ROM 1's DOS_ERROR_BANK0). Also reached\nfrom $2157 and $21AF.","comment":"Bank 0, the error stops it (NextZXOS ROM 1's DOS_ERROR_BANK0)"},
        "8277": {"comment":"The entries kept","synopsis":"BC kept, then CAT_ENTRY (from $203C)."},
        "8278": {"synopsis":"One file: A = the names left, HL = its entry; its long name, date, time and size from\nIDE_GET_LFN (ROM 2), kept by ROM 0's STORE_LFN_INFO.","comment":"The names left kept"},
        "8279": {"comment":"The entry's address kept"},
        "8280": {"comment":"DE = the entry"},
        "8281": {"comment":"HL = the name"},
        "8284": {"comment":"BC = $D827: the long name's buffer"},
        "8287": {"comment":"IX = the directory handle"},
        "8291": {"comment":"IDE_GET_LFN (ROM 2)"},
        "8294": {"comment":"An error"},
        "8296": {"comment":"The date, time and size kept (ROM 0's STORE_LFN_INFO)"},
        "8301": {"comment":"RAM bank 0"},
        "8304": {"comment":"BREAK stops it (NextZXOS ROM 1's BREAK_STOP)"},
        "8319": {"comment":"RAM bank 7"},
        "8322": {"comment":"'-' given ($5B66 bit 7)?"},
        "8326": {"comment":"No: the long name"},
        "8328": {"comment":"HL = the entry"},
        "8330": {"comment":"8 name letters"},
