        "8541": {"synopsis":"The sort's memory freed ($272D: DOS_CATALOG with B = 2, C = $20, A = 0); the free space on\nthe drive given, or on the default one (DOS_SET_DRIVE), printed with \" free\" ($240B, $246F).","comment":"The sort's memory freed ($272D)"},
        "8544": {"comment":"A drive letter given?"},
        "8548": {"comment":"Yes"},
        "8550": {"comment":"A = $FF: ask"},
        "8552": {"comment":"The default drive (DOS_SET_DRIVE, ROM 2)"},
        "8555": {"comment":"An error"},
