        "12542": {"synopsis":"KEPT_VARS_SET's (NextZXOS ROM 1) 5 new bytes, just written into a line before DE, put into\nthe GO SUB stack's type-1 entries that record that place too: $5CA8 = their address; the\nplace as an offset from PROG (main program) or a bank address (ROM 1's CACHE_TO_BANK); every\ntype-1 entry whose byte before the type is 0, whose bank is $5B77 and whose place matches\ngets the 5 bytes. Other entries are passed as STACK_TO_LINES passes them.\nEntry: DE = the address just past the 5 bytes.\nExit: DE as on entry.","comment":"DE kept"},
